    54	 * This is intended to be used with lambda functions.
    55	 *
    56	 * Note that this functions expects that, at the current location in @p stream,
    57	 * exactly @p length items have been encoded as a unit (and so it will not be
    58	 * partway through a run when it has decoded @p length items). If this is not
    59	 * the case, it will return @c false.
