    63	 * @param buf         The location to write the decoded data.
    64	 * @param length      The number of items to read.
    65	 * @param readData    A function that takes a QDataStream reference and reads a
    66	 *                    single value.
    67	 * @param updateItem  A function that takes an item from @p buf and the result
    68	 *                    of a readData call, and produces the item that should be
    69	 *                    written to @p buf.
